 style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"en-IN\">\n (</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri\"><span lang=\"ar-SA\"><span style=\"font-family: Mangal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\">उलझा\n हुआ</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"en-IN\">)\n - </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"en-IN\">Caught\n or involved in difficulties or complications; to be tangled or\n interlaced.</span></span></span></p>\n <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">  <span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"en-IN\"><b>Murky</b></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"en-IN\">\n (</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri\"><span lang=\"ar-SA\"><span style=\"font-family: Mangal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\">अस्पष्ट</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"en-IN\">)\n - </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"en-IN\">Dark\n or gloomy; unclear, confused, or difficult to understand.</span></span></span></p>\n <p>  <span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"en-IN\"><b>Haze</b></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"en-IN\">\n (</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri\"><span lang=\"ar-SA\"><span style=\"font-family: Mangal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\">हेज़</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"en-IN\">)\n - </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span lang=\"en-IN\">A\n fine mist, smoke, or dust that obscures visibility; a state of\n confusion or uncertainty</span></span></span></p>\n ",
