      "solution_en": "<p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1056px\">\n <span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\"><b>Fustian</b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">\n (</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">बड़बड़ाहट</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">)\n </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\"><b>-\n </b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">Pompous\n or pretentious speech or writing that is intended to impress but\n is actually empty or meaningless.</span></span></p>\n <p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1056px\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\"><b>Vestige\n </b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">अवशेष</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">)\n - A trace, mark, or visible sign left by something that no longer\n exists; a remaining bit or indication of something lost or\n vanished.</span></span></p>\n <p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1056px\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\"><b>Rogue\n </b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">धूर्त\n </span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">)\n - A dishonest or unprincipled person; a scoundrel or rascal;\n someone who behaves in an abnormal or unpredictable way.</span></span></p>\n <p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1056px\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\"><b>Pretentious</b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">\n (</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">दिखावटी</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">)-\n  Attempting to impress by affecting greater importance, talent,\n culture, etc., than is actually possessed; making an extravagant\n outward show, often to mask inner insecurity.</span></span></p>\n <p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\"><b>Ingenuous\n </b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">सरल</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">)\n - Innocent and unsuspecting; lacking in cunning or deceit;\n straightforward and candid in manner or behavior.</span></span></p>\n ",
      "solution_hi": "<p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1056px\">\n <span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\"><b>Fustian</b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">\n (</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">बड़बड़ाहट</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">)\n </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\"><b>-\n </b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">Pompous\n or pretentious speech or writing that is intended to impress but\n is actually empty or meaningless.</span></span></p>\n <p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1056px\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\"><b>Vestige\n </b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">अवशेष</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">)\n - A trace, mark, or visible sign left by something that no longer\n exists; a remaining bit or indication of something lost or\n vanished.</span></span></p>\n <p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1056px\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\"><b>Rogue\n </b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">धूर्त\n </span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">)\n - A dishonest or unprincipled person; a scoundrel or rascal;\n someone who behaves in an abnormal or unpredictable way.</span></span></p>\n <p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1056px\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\"><b>Pretentious</b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">\n (</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">दिखावटी</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">)-\n  Attempting to impress by affecting greater importance, talent,\n culture, etc., than is actually possessed; making an extravagant\n outward show, often to mask inner insecurity.</span></span></p>\n <p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\"><b>Ingenuous\n </b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\"><span style=\"font-family: Cambria\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">सरल</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px\">)\n - Innocent and unsuspecting; lacking in cunning or deceit;\n straightforward and candid in manner or behavior.</span></span></p>\n ",
